        <activityName xml:lang="en">District heat, at consumer, biomethane in industrial furnace 1MW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: District heat, at consumer, biomethane in industrial furnace 1MW
Inventory is valid for the district heat based on heat from biomethane in heating plant only. Heat loss is 11% while heat transportation.;
Synonyms: Fernwärme, an Abnehmer, Feuerung Biogas, aufbereitet 1MW; 
UUID: cceddd61-8473-31b0-aa3c-59c81d67abe3
Included is the infrastructure of the deliverysystem for district heat, the losses and the heat from bioomethane at industrial furnace 1MWth.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: heat efficieny based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cceddd61-8473-31b0-aa3c-59c81d67abe3.xml</text>
